```

If `control` is present, `_is_single_cell_widths(text)` might be true if `text` is empty or contains only single-width characters.
If `control` is present, `text` is usually empty.
If `text` is empty, `_is_single_cell_widths("")` is probably true.
Then `cut >= len("")` is `cut >= 0`, which is true for `cut >= 0`.
It returns `(self, Segment("", style, control))`.

